      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KISS FOR CASH (4) was a strong winner (25.50) from box 7 last time, scoring by 4 lengths at this track. Has the squeeze box to overcome and will need the breaks early. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. LOVE ME LUNA (5) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at Warragul over 460m behind Attica Blue (26.54) in a Mix 6/7 FIN. Was in the money prior to that. The form out of her last race has been franked. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. SUNTORY EVE (7) unwanted in betting but showed good early dash and led until late, finishing third and beaten 3.5 lengths (25.98) at this track in a Restricted WIN over 450m. Winning chance. ASTON TARZAN (1) is worth a look despite no experience at this circuit.",
